   b) Modification: You may modify, extend and recompile the software and use the
      modified version as under a).
   c) Internal sharing: You may share the software (including modified versions) with
      your own team, your hosting provider or a service provider maintaining your
      server - solely for operating that server and not publicly.
   d) Client mods: Players may use client mods on their own devices if they obtain them
      from an official source. Server operators may refer and link their players to
      the official source for this purpose.
   e) Contributions: You may submit changes as a pull request to the official
      repository. By submitting, you grant the copyright holder the right to use and
      publish your contribution under this license.
   f) Forks on GitHub are allowed as far as provided for by GitHub's Terms of Service
      and solely for preparing contributions under e).

2. NOT PERMITTED
